sequenceDiagram
    participant User as User (web app)
    participant API as Lambda API
    participant Auth as Supabase Auth
    participant Discord
    participant DB as Supabase (PostgreSQL)
    User->>API: Start sign-in: POST /auth/login/discord
    API-->>User: OAuth URL and login cookie
    User->>Auth: Open OAuth URL
    Note over Auth,Discord: User completes Discord sign-in and consent
    Auth-->>User: Redirect with authorization code
    User->>API: GET /auth/callback with code and login cookie
    API->>Auth: Exchange code and verify identity
    Auth-->>API: Session tokens and Discord credentials
    API->>Discord: Verify identity and guild membership
    Discord-->>API: Eligible member
    API->>DB: Save membership, then provision league account
    DB-->>API: Account ready
    API-->>User: Set session cookies and redirect to app
